								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								dread lizard<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=41"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=535.msg4090#msg4090"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=535.msg4090#msg4090">Re:Ascent -&gt; ssnakess, karadana, mamael, other asshole names I forget</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #15 on:</b> December 27, 2003, 08:08:34 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							lots of words. to early to read yet.<br /><br />i hope next expansion has more raid content.<br /><br />fighting over vindi? come on. &nbsp;whoever clears and is there first, but damn.<br /><br />and i really dont think people care who you are or what guild you are in.<br /><br />btw i think this is pretty funny and sad. but funny more.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg4091"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=269" title="View the profile of Ssnakess">Ssnakess</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Gecko not Geico<br />
								Global Moderator<br />
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 277<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/kof1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								die plz<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=269"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.ascentguild.com" title="Ascent Guild" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Ssnakess@mail2hell.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=535.msg4091#msg4091"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=535.msg4091#msg4091">Re:Ascent -&gt; ssnakess, karadana, mamael, other asshole names I forget</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #16 on:</b> December 27, 2003, 10:56:30 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hmm, where to begin.<br /><br />First off. &nbsp;Kinsonn, you need to learn to keep your mouth shut, and only speak when spoken to.<br /><br />After the initial wipes, on both parts, I spoke with both Cudget and Brokenfang (leader and officer) from your guild. &nbsp;About who&#039;s alt Slaeny is, and about the incident itself. &nbsp;Brokenfang agreed that your guild would get another shot, and if you failed we would kill it.<br /><br />And, as Cartier said, &quot;If you were trying to accomplish something, they not only would give you a shot trying, they would probably give a hand.&quot;.<br /><br />When Vindi hit 25%, my crew and I all came in to help finish the kill.<br /><br />So let me just summarize. &nbsp;Kinsonn, you run your mouth too much and obviously don&#039;t know your place in your own guild, much less the rest of the game. &nbsp;So before you go running your mouth and talking trash, take a second to collect your thoughts, make sure you aren&#039;t spewing a load of bullshit, and try to think a rational thought.<br /><br />We didn&#039;t know you had intentions of Vindi, we thought we were the first ones there regardless, I was the first to aggro Vindi (kiting for split tagging), and we had every opportunity to take it back before you engaged.<br /><br />Oh, and yes, we were rather civil. &nbsp;I mean in all rights, I could&#039;ve just..not spoken to your officers...and pulled Vindi as soon as we were ready. &nbsp;I could&#039;ve decided not to pull the mobs blocking your access to Vindi (I &lt;3 repops). &nbsp;I could&#039;ve trained you with every mob in the hallway to Statue + Vindi for fun and excitement.<br /><br />Furthermore, Garadan is right on the money. &nbsp;When a 6 man crew from, oh...lets say Fires of Time, decides to kill a mob you are wanting as well. &nbsp;Do you say, &quot;OMFG FIRES OF TIME KSED US !!!!!!!!!!!&quot;? &nbsp;What&#039;s that? &nbsp;You don&#039;t??? &nbsp;So shut the fuck up with this whiny &quot;Ascent is EVIL they tried to kill OUR MOB&quot;. &nbsp;Because rest assured, if it was the guild rather than 6 people, the mob would&#039;ve died before half your guild zoned in.<br /><br />Let me just clear that up for you. &nbsp;6 people != a guild.<br /><br />Oh and Brokenfang is a fucking cool guy, he was quite nice and civil. &nbsp;And he even understood that both parties thought they had Vindi to themselves until I started to pull Vindi and the proverbial shit hit the fan.<br /><br />All this negativity happening the day after Christmas...such love.<br /><br />Guess you didn&#039;t get what you wanted, Kinsonn &nbsp;:o
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=423577" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.webpost.net/ss/Ssnakess/Ssnakess2D2.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
